Scope note

This license covers the text, scripts, patch and diagrams authored in this
repository. It does NOT grant any rights to NVIDIA firmware, VBIOS images,
or any derived binary — none of which is distributed here.

The unlock mechanism originated in the following MIT-licensed projects and
this repository's description of it inherits their provenance:

  PZH1gdmu/CMP40HX-Unlock            (MIT)  original exploit chain
  xrip/cmp50hx-unlock                (MIT)  TU102 / GSP port, pinned df2fe11
  chenxluo/tu102-22g-uefi-unlock     (MIT)  22 GiB + Windows + UEFI route

KohakuBlueleaf/KohakUnlock (GPL-2.0) was consulted for public documentation of
measured constants and observed behaviour only; no code from it is included.
